{"4523040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Judge SIM", "steam_appid": 4523040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4933900], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Judge Sim</strong>, you step into the role of a judge responsible for resolving complex courtroom cases. Listen carefully to witnesses, analyze evidence, uncover contradictions, and make decisions that can change the fate of the accused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truth is not always obvious. Justice depends on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case is a legal puzzle where you must maintain control of the courtroom, evaluate witness credibility, and decide whether to sustain or overrule objections. One wrong decision could lead to an unjust verdict—or allow the guilty to walk free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/0a8f6ee3de23c2f85d96da65feaa02cb.avif?t=1786101373\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your career, you will face dozens of unique cases filled with unexpected twists, hidden evidence, and conflicting testimonies. Can you uncover the truth and deliver justice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/4b7f3780b6d2b9ab9655111d65eff191.poster.avif?t=1786101373\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/4b7f3780b6d2b9ab9655111d65eff191.webm?t=1786101373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/4b7f3780b6d2b9ab9655111d65eff191.mp4?t=1786101373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ Listen to testimonies and analyze statements<br>📂 Examine evidence and uncover contradictions<br>👨‍⚖️ Rule on objections and control the courtroom<br>🧩 Solve unique cases full of twists<br>📈 Build your career as a judge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Justice is in your hands.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Judge Sim</strong>, you step into the role of a judge responsible for resolving complex courtroom cases. Listen carefully to witnesses, analyze evidence, uncover contradictions, and make decisions that can change the fate of the accused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truth is not always obvious. Justice depends on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case is a legal puzzle where you must maintain control of the courtroom, evaluate witness credibility, and decide whether to sustain or overrule objections. One wrong decision could lead to an unjust verdict—or allow the guilty to walk free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/0a8f6ee3de23c2f85d96da65feaa02cb.avif?t=1786101373\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your career, you will face dozens of unique cases filled with unexpected twists, hidden evidence, and conflicting testimonies. Can you uncover the truth and deliver justice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/4b7f3780b6d2b9ab9655111d65eff191.poster.avif?t=1786101373\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/4b7f3780b6d2b9ab9655111d65eff191.webm?t=1786101373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/extras/4b7f3780b6d2b9ab9655111d65eff191.mp4?t=1786101373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ Listen to testimonies and analyze statements<br>📂 Examine evidence and uncover contradictions<br>👨‍⚖️ Rule on objections and control the courtroom<br>🧩 Solve unique cases full of twists<br>📈 Build your career as a judge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Justice is in your hands.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the role of a judge and decide the fate of every case. Listen to witnesses, examine evidence, uncover contradictions, and deliver verdicts that will change lives. Every decision matters in this tense courtroom simulation full of twists.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523040/cfd3c730f88e839eb1a8b7809eae18dbce8cf633/heade